# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it"): s3-review's panels as typed. A note kept shown and one
# with two lines (¶ in the note box), a comment thread with two replies and one resolved thread
# (Excel 2021 reads threads as their notes: "[Threaded comment]... Comment: ... Reply: ..."), links
# with their text to display (a web address, an e-mail address), one link removed again, input
# cells unlocked, the sheet protected with a password and two permissions, the workbook's
# structure protected with a password. The password is "fixture": the read-back checks that Excel
# takes it.
sheet-name "Budget"
enter A1 "Item"
enter B1 "Amount"
enter A2 "Rent"
enter B2 "950"
enter A3 "Power"
enter B3 "120"
enter A4 "Total"
enter B4 "=SUM(B2:B3)"
note A2 "Due on the 1st" shown
note A3 "Estimate¶Check the meter"
comment B2 "Is this the new rent?"
reply B2 "Yes, from March"
reply B2 "Thanks"
comment B3 "Ask for the bill"
resolve B3
link A6 "https://example.com/rent" "Rent contract"
link A7 "someone@example.com" "Mail the landlord"
link A8 "https://example.com/old"
unlink A8
unlock B2:B3
protect password=fixture allow=formatcells,insertrows
protect-book password=fixture
save
expect cell Budget!B4 text 1070
expect note Budget!A2 *:\nDue on the 1st
expect note Budget!A2 shown
expect note Budget!A3 *:\nEstimate\nCheck the meter
expect note Budget!B2 [[]Threaded comment]*Comment:\n    Is this the new rent?\nReply:\n    Yes, from March\nReply:\n    Thanks
expect note Budget!B3 [[]Threaded comment]*Comment:\n    Ask for the bill
expect link Budget!A6 address https://example.com/rent place  text Rent contract
expect link Budget!A7 address mailto:someone@example.com place  text Mail the landlord
expect cell Budget!B2 unlocked
expect cell Budget!B3 unlocked
expect protect Budget allow FormattingCells,InsertingRows
expect protect Budget select 0 objects True
expect protect Budget password fixture
expect protect-book structure
expect protect-book password fixture
